WEBVTT

00:00:08.458 --> 00:00:10.098
(ELSA PANTING)

00:00:13.578 --> 00:00:14.778
(CREATURE NEIGHS)

00:00:18.858 --> 00:00:20.458
Of course.

00:00:20.898 --> 00:00:24.858
(SIGHS)
Glaciers are rivers of ice.

00:00:26.378 --> 00:00:28.618
Ahtohallan is frozen.

00:00:28.698 --> 00:00:30.818
-(THE VOICE VOCALIZING)
-(GASPS)

00:00:33.698 --> 00:00:35.298
I hear you.

00:00:35.498 --> 00:00:36.898
And I'm coming.

00:00:37.898 --> 00:00:39.898
(SOFT MUSIC PLAYING)

00:00:43.658 --> 00:00:46.618
(SINGING)
Every inch of me is trembling

00:00:46.778 --> 00:00:51.298
But not from the cold

00:00:52.098 --> 00:00:54.538
Something is familiar

00:00:54.698 --> 00:00:59.338
Like a dream
I can reach but not quite hold

00:00:59.698 --> 00:01:01.538
I can sense you there

00:01:02.778 --> 00:01:06.938
Like a friend
I've always known

00:01:07.658 --> 00:01:10.778
I'm arriving

00:01:10.938 --> 00:01:15.098
And it feels like I am home

00:01:15.658 --> 00:01:19.538
I have always been a fortress

00:01:19.698 --> 00:01:23.498
Cold secrets deep inside

00:01:24.098 --> 00:01:27.618
You have secrets, too

00:01:27.938 --> 00:01:31.818
But you don't have to hide

00:01:31.978 --> 00:01:34.538
Show yourself

00:01:34.698 --> 00:01:37.578
I'm dying to meet you

00:01:38.098 --> 00:01:40.098
Show yourself

00:01:41.098 --> 00:01:43.378
It's your turn

00:01:44.098 --> 00:01:50.698
Are you the one I've been
looking for all of my life?

00:01:52.178 --> 00:01:54.938
Show yourself

00:01:55.098 --> 00:01:58.458
I'm ready to learn

00:01:58.538 --> 00:02:00.538
(VOCALIZING)

00:02:02.538 --> 00:02:04.418
(THE VOICE VOCALIZES)

00:02:05.418 --> 00:02:07.498
I've never felt so certain

00:02:08.218 --> 00:02:12.578
All my life I've been torn

00:02:13.258 --> 00:02:15.978
But I'm here for a reason

00:02:16.138 --> 00:02:20.538
Could it be the reason
I was born?

00:02:20.698 --> 00:02:24.298
I have always been
so different

00:02:24.458 --> 00:02:27.258
Normal rules did not apply

00:02:28.698 --> 00:02:32.098
Is this the day?
Are you the way

00:02:32.258 --> 00:02:36.338
I finally find out why?

00:02:36.538 --> 00:02:38.618
Show yourself!

00:02:38.778 --> 00:02:42.138
I'm no longer trembling

00:02:42.298 --> 00:02:44.498
Here I am

00:02:44.658 --> 00:02:47.738
I've come so far

00:02:48.098 --> 00:02:50.858
You are the answer
I've waited for

00:02:51.018 --> 00:02:54.738
All of my life

00:02:54.898 --> 00:02:57.978
Oh, show yourself!

00:02:58.138 --> 00:03:02.338
Let me see who you are

00:03:03.258 --> 00:03:06.778
Come to me now

00:03:07.298 --> 00:03:09.938
Open your door

00:03:11.178 --> 00:03:14.858
Don't make me wait

00:03:15.018 --> 00:03:17.858
One moment more

00:03:18.298 --> 00:03:22.498
Oh, come to me now

00:03:22.658 --> 00:03:26.298
Open your door

00:03:26.538 --> 00:03:29.378
Don't make me wait

00:03:30.338 --> 00:03:36.338
One moment more

00:03:41.058 --> 00:03:44.778
CHORUS: Where the Northwind

00:03:44.978 --> 00:03:48.538
-Meets the sea
-(VOCALIZES)

00:03:48.618 --> 00:03:52.138
-There's a river
-(VOCALIZES)

00:03:52.298 --> 00:03:53.378
Full of memory

00:03:53.538 --> 00:03:54.818
Mother.

00:03:55.938 --> 00:04:00.658
Come, my darling,
homeward bound

00:04:01.338 --> 00:04:03.978
I am found!

00:04:06.218 --> 00:04:08.538
ELSA AND IDUNA:
Show yourself

00:04:08.698 --> 00:04:11.778
Step into your power

00:04:11.938 --> 00:04:14.498
Grow yourself

00:04:14.658 --> 00:04:17.738
Into something new

00:04:17.898 --> 00:04:20.738
IDUNA: You are the one
you've been waiting for

00:04:20.898 --> 00:04:24.338
-All of my life
-IDUNA: All of your life

00:04:24.698 --> 00:04:29.258
Oh, show yourself!

00:04:30.138 --> 00:04:33.578
-(VOCALIZING)
-(CHORUS HARMONIZING)

